 "queue": "hr",
 "summary": "Employee E036 Noah Fischer (Sales Engineer, Sales) asks whether he is allowed to do freelance consulting on weekends. I checked the policy index; POL-SEC-01 (security and acceptable use) does not cover outside work, and no policy I read addresses outside employment or side work. Needs an HR decision/guidance."
}

{
 "kind": "escalated",
 "message": "I couldn't find a policy that answers whether you can do freelance consulting on weekends. The security policy I checked (POL-SEC-01) covers account and data handling, not outside work. I've passed your question to the HR team, who can tell you what applies. If the consulting would use company laptops, accounts, or files, mention that to HR too, since those rules are in POL-SEC-01 and POL-EQP-01.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-SEC-01"
 ]
}
